{"title":"Database Engineer Roadmap","role":"Database Engineer","summary":"A Database Engineer designs, develops, optimizes, secures, and maintains the database systems that support software applications and business operations.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Information Science & Engineering (ISE)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Database Engineer designs, develops, optimizes, secures, and maintains the database systems that support software applications and business operations."},{"type":"p","text":"The role goes beyond writing SQL queries. A strong Database Engineer understands:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Relational database architecture"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Data modeling"},{"text":"Database performance"},{"text":"Indexing"},{"text":"Transactions"},{"text":"Concurrency"},{"text":"High availability"},{"text":"Backup and recovery"},{"text":"Database security"},{"text":"Cloud databases"},{"text":"Distributed databases"},{"text":"Data pipelines"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"The career sits between software engineering, data engineering, infrastructure, and database administration."}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Database Engineer can specialize in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Database Engineering"},{"text":"Database Development"},{"text":"Database Administration"},{"text":"Cloud Database Engineering"},{"text":"Database Performance Engineering"},{"text":"Distributed Database Engineering"},{"text":"Data Platform Engineering"},{"text":"Data Engineering"},{"text":"Database Reliability Engineering"},{"text":"Database Security"},{"text":"Data Architecture"},{"text":"Big Data Infrastructure"},{"text":"NoSQL Engineering"},{"text":"Database DevOps"},{"text":"AI Data Infrastructure"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 1 — Programming & Database Foundations","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build strong computer science fundamentals."},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Java"},{"text":"C/C++ basics"},{"text":"Data Structures & Algorithms"},{"text":"Object-Oriented Programming"},{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"Python is particularly useful for database automation and data engineering."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Computer Science"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DBMS"},{"text":"Operating Systems"},{"text":"Computer Networks"},{"text":"Computer Architecture"},{"text":"Software Engineering"}]}]},{"heading":"SQL Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"SQL should become one of the strongest skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"INSERT"},{"text":"UPDATE"},{"text":"DELETE"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"HAVING"},{"text":"ORDER BY"},{"text":"JOINs"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"Views"},{"text":"Stored procedures"},{"text":"Functions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Application","SQL Query","Query Optimizer","Database Engine","Storage"]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand what happens inside the database, not just how to write queries."}]},{"heading":"Relational Database Systems","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start deeply with one major relational database."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended primary database"},{"type":"h","text":"PostgreSQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Then gain familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MySQL"},{"text":"Microsoft SQL Server"},{"text":"Oracle Database"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tables"},{"text":"Constraints"},{"text":"Primary keys"},{"text":"Foreign keys"},{"text":"Relationships"},{"text":"Transactions"},{"text":"Views"},{"text":"Stored procedures"},{"text":"Triggers"},{"text":"Schemas"}]}]},{"heading":"Data Modeling"