-performance costs."}]},{"heading":"Transactions & Concurrency","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ACID"},{"text":"Atomicity"},{"text":"Consistency"},{"text":"Isolation"},{"text":"Durability"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand isolation levels:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Read Uncommitted"},{"text":"Read Committed"},{"text":"Repeatable Read"},{"text":"Serializable"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Locks"},{"text":"Deadlocks"},{"text":"Race conditions"},{"text":"MVCC"},{"text":"Optimistic concurrency"},{"text":"Pessimistic concurrency"},{"text":"These concepts are essential for financial, transactional and high-scale applications."}]}]},{"heading":"Database Security","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Authorization"},{"text":"Roles"},{"text":"Privileges"},{"text":"Encryption"},{"text":"TLS"},{"text":"Secrets management"},{"text":"Row-level security"},{"text":"Auditing"},{"text":"SQL injection prevention"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Application flow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["User","Application","Authentication","Authorization","Database","Auditing / Monitoring"]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand that application security and database security must work together."}]},{"heading":"Backup & Disaster Recovery","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Database Engineer must understand how to recover data."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Full backups"},{"text":"Incremental backups"},{"text":"Point-in-time recovery"},{"text":"WAL"},{"text":"Replication"},{"text":"Restore testing"},{"text":"Disaster recovery"},{"text":"Recovery Point Objective (RPO)"},{"text":"Recovery Time Objective (RTO)"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important principle:"},{"type":"p","text":"A backup that has never been successfully restored is not a proven recovery strategy."}]},{"heading":"High Availability","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Replication"},{"text":"Primary/replica architecture"},{"text":"Failover"},{"text":"Read replicas"},{"text":"Connection pooling"},{"text":"Load balancing"},{"text":"Health checks"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Application","Connection Pool","┌─────────┴─────────┐"]},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"↓ ↓"},{"text":"Primary DB Read Replica"},{"text":"↓ ↓"},{"text":"Writes Reads"},{"text":"Understand the trade-offs between availability, consistency, performance and complexity."}]}]},{"heading":"Cloud Databases","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cloud skills are increasingly important."},{"text":"Learn at least one cloud platform."}]},{"type":"h","text":"AWS"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"RDS"},{"text":"Aurora"},{"text":"DynamoDB"},{"text":"ElastiCache"},{"text":"S3"},{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"CloudWatch"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also gain awareness of equivalent services in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microsoft Azure"},{"text":"Google Cloud"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Managed databases"},{"text":"Automated backups"},{"text":"Scaling"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Networking"},{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"Encryption"}]}]},{"heading":"NoSQL Databases","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Database Engineer should understand when relational databases are not the best fit."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Document"},{"type":"p","text":"MongoDB"},{"type":"h","text":"Key-value"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Redis"},{"text":"DynamoDB"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Wide-column"},{"type":"p","text":"Cassandra"},{"type":"h","text":"Graph"},{"type":"p","text":"Neo4j"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the trade-off between:"},{"type":"h","text":"SQL vs NoSQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Do not assume NoSQL automatically means faster or more scalable."}]},{"heading":"Distributed Databases","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For advanced roles, study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Replication"},{"text":"Sharding"},{"text":"Partitioning"},{"text":"Consistent hashing"},{"text":"Consensus concepts"},{"text":"Quorum"},{"text":"CAP theorem"},{"text":"Eventual consistency"},{"text":"Distributed transactions"},{"text":"Failure handling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Architecture:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Application","Routing Layer","┌────────────┼────────────┐"]},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"text":"Shard 1 Shard 2 Shard 3"},{"text":"Learn why distributing data introduces additional complexity."}]}]},{"heading":"Database DevOps","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how databases fit into CI/CD."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Database migrations"},{"text":"Schema versioning"},{"text":"Automated testing"},{"text":"Deployment strategies"},{"text":"Rollbacks"},{"text":"Infrastructure as Code"},{"text":"Configuration management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools/ecosystem:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Flyway"},{"text":"Liquibase"},{"text":"Alembic"},{"text":"Terraform"},{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"GitHub Actions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Code Change","Migration Script","Automated Test","Staging Database","Validation","Production"]}]},{"heading":"Data Engineering Integration","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A modern Database Engineer benefits from understanding data pipelines."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ETL"},{"text":"ELT"},{"text":"Data warehouses"},{"text":"Data lakes"},{"text":"Batch processing"},{"text":"Streaming"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Data lineage"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Technologies to explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Apache Spark"},{"text":"Kafka"},{"text":"Airflow"},{"text":"dbt"},{"text":"Snowflake"},{"text":"BigQuery"},{"text":"This can open a pathway toward Data Platform Engineer / Data Engineer roles."}]}]},{"heading":"AI & Database Engineering","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI applications increasingly depend on database infrastructure."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vector databases"},{"text":"Embeddings"},{"text":"Vector search"},{"text":"Hybrid search"},{"text":"Metadata filtering"},{"text":"RAG architecture"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Documents","Embeddings","Vector Database","Similarity Search","LLM"]},{"type":"p","text":"Gain familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"pgvector"},{"text":"Pinecone"},{"text":"Qdrant"},{"text":"Weaviate"},{"text":"FAISS"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong modern specialization is:"},{"type":"h","text":"Database Engineering + AI Data Infrastructure"}]},{"heading":"Database Observability","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to monitor production databases."},{"type":"p","text":"Monitor:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Query latency"},{"text":"CPU"},{"text":"Memory"},{"text":"Disk usage"},{"text":"Connections"},{"text":"Cache hit ratio"},{"text":"Lock contention"},{"text":"Replication lag"},{"text":"Slow queries"},{"text":"Error rates"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Database","Metrics + Logs + Traces","Monitoring","Alert","Investigation","Optimization"]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — E-Commerce Database"},{"type":"p","text":"Design:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Users"},{"text":"Products"},{"text":"Orders"},{"text":"Payments"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Shipping"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ER diagram"},{"text":"Normalization"},{"text":"Constraints"},{"text":"Indexing"},{"text":"Transactions"},{"text":"Complex SQL queries"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Database Performance Lab"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a large dataset an