]},{"type":"p","text":"AI will increase the importance of data quality, retrieval infrastructure, vector search, and database observability, rather than making database engineering obsolete."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Technology Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Core"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PostgreSQL"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"Git"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Relational"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PostgreSQL"},{"text":"MySQL"},{"text":"SQL Server"},{"text":"Oracle awareness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"NoSQL"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MongoDB"},{"text":"Redis"},{"text":"DynamoDB"},{"text":"Cassandra awareness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWS RDS"},{"text":"Aurora"},{"text":"DynamoDB"},{"text":"S3"},{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"CloudWatch"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Engineering"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Kafka"},{"text":"Spark"},{"text":"Airflow"},{"text":"dbt"},{"text":"Snowflake/BigQuery"}]},{"type":"h","text":"DevOps"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"Terraform"},{"text":"GitHub Actions"},{"text":"Flyway/Liquibase/Alembic"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"pgvector"},{"text":"FAISS"},{"text":"Pinecone"},{"text":"Qdrant"}]}]},{"heading":"Suggested 4-Year Learning Path","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"YEAR 1"},{"type":"flow","items":["Programming + DBMS + SQL + Linux + CS Fundamentals","YEAR 2"]},{"type":"flow","items":["PostgreSQL + Data Modeling + Transactions + Indexing","YEAR 3"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Query Optimization + HA/DR + Cloud + NoSQL + DevOps","YEAR 4"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Distributed Databases + Data Engineering + AI Data Infrastructure","GRADUATION"]},{"type":"p","text":"Database Engineer / Cloud Database Engineer"}]},{"heading":"Portfolio Requirements","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, aim for 4–6 substantial projects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Production-style relational database"},{"text":"Database performance optimization project"},{"text":"High-availability/backup project"},{"text":"Cloud database deployment"},{"text":"Data pipeline project"},{"text":"AI/vector database application"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Each project should demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ER diagram"},{"text":"Schema design"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Indexing strategy"},{"text":"Performance analysis"},{"text":"Security"},{"text":"Backup/recovery"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Documentation"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should be able to take a requirement such as:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Design the database architecture for a large e-commerce platform.\""},{"type":"p","text":"and reason through:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Requirements","Data Model","Schema Design","Normalization","Indexes","Transactions","Query Optimization","Replication","Backup / Recovery","Security","Monitoring","Scaling"]},{"type":"p","text":"They should be able to explain why each database design decision was made rather than simply creating tables."}]},{"heading":"Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize:"},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"h","text":"DBMS Fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"PostgreSQL"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Modeling"},{"type":"h","text":"Transactions & Concurrency"},{"type":"h","text":"Indexing"},{"type":"h","text":"Query Optimization"},{"type":"h","text":"Database Internals"},{"type":"h","text":"Python & Automation"},{"type":"h","text":"Linux"},{"type":"h","text":"Backup & Recovery"},{"type":"h","text":"Replication & High Availability"},{"type":"h","text":"Database Security"},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud Databases"},{"type":"h","text":"NoSQL"},{"type":"h","text":"Distributed Systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Database DevOps"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Engineering"},{"type":"h","text":"Database Observability"},{"type":"h","text":"Vector Databases & AI Data Infrastructure"},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech ISE","Advanced SQL","PostgreSQL","Database Internals","Performance Engineering","Cloud Databases","Reliability","Data Engineering"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest candidate should not position themselves merely as a SQL Developer. The target should be a production-oriented Database Engineer who can design schemas, optimize queries, understand database internals, automate operations, build reliable cloud database systems, implement security and recovery, and handle increasingly distributed and AI-driven data workloads."},{"type":"p","text":"For the 2026+ market, the strongest specialization combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Database Engineering","Cloud","Distributed Systems","Data Engineering","AI Data Infrastructure."],"sep":"+"}]}]}